cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark suite or its models, please cite it as below."
title: "MODA General Attribute Suite"
abstract: >-
  A three-track public benchmark for fashion attribute extraction from images,
  covering localized garment crops, catalog product images, and applicability-aware
  full-body attributes. Each track has its own frozen test set, input contract, and
  metric; predictions are committed by hash before labels are opened; scoring is
  fail-closed and promotion requires a positive paired confidence interval on every
  track.
type: software
